    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eigilaki aashet esuntai e Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye Eliashib ilo apolosani kitok, tenebo ilalashera lenyena, lelo apolosak, neshet ninche kishomi oo nkerra. Neitisiny ninche ina kishomi, nepik nkikeneta enyena. Neitisiny ninche ina kishomi o meitabaiki oltalet le iip nelo abaiki oltalet le Hananel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enetashare ninye neshet Iltung'ana le Yeriko. Ore enetashare ninche neshet Sakar olayioni le Imri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Hasena neshet kishomi oo sinkir; eitoluaa ninche iloom, nepik nkikeneta enyena o lmushumaani lenyena, o sekenke enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enetashare ninche, neitobir aram Meremot olayioni le Uria, olayioni le Hakos. Ore enetashare ninche neitobir aram Meshulam olayioni le Berekia, olayioni le Meshesabel. Ore enetashare ninche neitobir aram Sadok olayioni le Baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enetashare ninche neitobir aaram iltung'ana le Tekoa, kake ore lelo kituaak lenye eitu ninche epik imurto ina siaai o Laitoriani lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Yoida olayioni le Pasea o Mehulam olayioni le Besodia, neitobir aaram enkishomi musana. Nepik iloom lenyena o nkikeneta enyena, o lmushumaani lenyena; o sekenke enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enetashare ninche, neitobir aram Melatia le Gebeon o Yadon le Meron, o ltung'ana le Gebeon o le Mispa, apa ootii abori enkitoria o lbalusui leilo kerenket te lido kekun o lkeju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enetashare ninche neitobir aram Usiel olayioni le Harbaia, ilo kunoni. Ore enetashare ninye neitobir aram Hanania, ilo obo loo laitobirak loo sonkoyoni; Neshet ninche Yerusalem o meitabaiki e suntai dapash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enetashare ninche, neitobir Aram Refaia olayioni le Huri, ilo aitoriani le nchoto e Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olotashare ninche neitobir aram Yedia olayioni le Harumap, ina kipirakinoto e nkaji enye. Ore enetashare ninye neitobir aram Hatush olayioni le Hashabneia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Malkija olayioni le Harim o Hashub olayioni le Pahat Moab neitobir aaram enkae rishata tenebo oltalet lo lkokuet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enetashare ninye neitobir aram Shalum olayioni le Halohesh, ilo aitoriani le nchoto nabo e Yerusalem, neshet ninye o ntoyie enyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Hanam o lelo oomanya Senoa, neitobir aaram enkishomi o erata; neshetu ninche ninye nepik nkikeneta enyena, o lmushumaani lenyena o sekenke enyena, neram ntemat e nkaina e nkalifu nabo e suntai, o meitabaiki kishomi e modioi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Malkija olayioni le Rekab, ilo aitoriani lo lkerenket le Bethashekem, neitobir aram enkishomi e modioi, neitoki ashet ninye nepik nkikeneta enyena, o lmushumaani lenyena, o sekenke enyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Shalum olayioni le Galhose, ilo aitoriani lo lkerenket le Mispa neram aitobir, enkishomi e nkong'u enkare. Etesheta ninye neimulumul nepik nkikeneta enyena, o lmushumaani lenyena, o sekenke enyena. Neshet ninye esuntai o lchorro le Shela, le nkurma o laiguanani, omeitabaiki nkedeta naadoyio aapuo enkanasa e Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye, neitobir aram Nehemia olayioni le Asbak, ilo aitoriani le nchoto nabo o lkerenket le Betsar o meitabaiki enkipirakinoto oo nkuraren e Daudi, o meitabaiki olchorro oitobiruaki, o meitabaiki enkaji oo ltung'ana magil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ile Lawi ootesheta esuntai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye neitobir Ilawi aaram: Reham olayioni le Bani; ore te siadi ninye naa Shashabia, ilo aitoriani lo lpisiaai lo lkerenket le Keila, neram aitobir olkerenket lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye neitobir aaram ilalashera lenye; Bafai olayioni le Hanadad, ilo aitoriani le nchoto nabo o lkerenket le Keila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore olosujaki ninye naa Eser olayioni le Yoshua, ilo aitoriani le Mispa, neitobir aram enkae rishata, enkipirakinoto e wueji neshumieki imasaa o larrabal teine nelojare e suntai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye neitobir aram Baruk enkae rishata ebaiki elojata e suntai o meitabaiki kutukaji e nkaji e Eliaship ilo apolosani kitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye naa Meremot olayioni le Uria, olayioni le Hakos oitobira enkae rishata, ebaiki kutukaji e nkaji e Eliab o metabaiki enkiting'oto, e nkaji e Eliaship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilapolosak ootaasa esiaai e nchetata e suntai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye naa ilapolosak, lelo tung'ana le nkisiajata, ooitobira aaram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninche neitobir aaram Benchamen o Hashab enkipirakinoto e nkaji enye. Ore te siadi ninche neitobir aram Asaria olayioni le Maaseia, olayioni le Anania embata e nkaji enye makewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye naa Benui olayioni le Hanadad oitobira aram enkae rishata, ebaiki enkaji e Asaria ometabaiki elojata e suntai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo abaiki olpijata. Ore Palal olayioni le Usai neitobir aram enkipirakinoto elojata o ilo talet oipang'u te nkaji e shumata o laiguanani to lgoriet le rripore. Ore te siadi ninye neitobir aaram Pedaia olayioni le Parosh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tenebo ilaisiaayiak le nkaji e Nkai ootii Ofel ewueji neipirakinore kishomi e nkare, te nkalo o loo saen oilo talet oilep shumata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kulikae ashetak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye neitobir iltung'ana le Tekoa enkae rishata te nkipirakinoto eilo talet oilep shumata, o metabaiki esuntai e Ofel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore shumata enkishomi oo mbartan neitobir ilapolosak aaram, oltung'ani ake enkipirakinoto e nkaji enye makewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninche neitobir aram Sadok olayioni le Imer enkipirakinoto e nkaji enye. Ore te siadi ninye neram Shemaia olayioni le Shekemia, ilo arriponi le kishomi e nkalo o loosaen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye neitobir aram Hanania olayioni le Shelemia, o Hanam ilo ayioni le ile le Selap neitobir aram enkae rishata. Ore te siadi ninye neitobir aram Meshalam olayioni le Berekia enkipirakinoto e nkaji enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi ninye, neshet aram Malkija obo loo lkunono omeitabaiki enkaji oo laisiaayiak le nkaji e Nkai, o ewueji oo lamirak enkipirakinoto e kishomi e rripore, o meitabaiki enkaji e shumata natii olpijata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ebaiki olgilata le shumata o metabaiki kishomi oo nkerra, neitobir aaram ilkunono le sahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
